Domain & $\gamma$ & $P(\gamma\!<\!0)$ & $\gamma$ & $P(\gamma\!<\!0)$ & PPP & $\hat{R}$ \\
\midrule
MMLU: Math & +0.50 & 8.1\% & +0.60 & 3.8\% & 0.305 & 1.007 \\
MMLU: Science & +0.50 & 7.8\% & +0.57 & 4.3\% & 0.197 & 1.007 \\
